<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly</p>
<p>annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by</p>
<p>banks</p>
<p>and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to</p>
<p>spot/six</p>
<p>months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  1.74 %		    C/S =  2.55%</p>
<p>	   O/N =  2.55 %		    O/N =  2.55%</p>
<p>	   T/N =  1.27 %		    T/N =  2.55%</p>
<p>		   June 26, 1997		     June 25, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  2.38 %     1 month forward =  3.39 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  2.72 %     2 month forward =  3.56 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  3.05 %     3 month forward =  3.74 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  3.48 %     4 month forward =  4.07 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  3.73 %     5 month forward =  4.28 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  3.79 %     6 month forward =  4.35 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
